This project is an independent, unofficial tool. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft Corporation. "Windows", "Microsoft
Store" and "Cross Device Experience Host" are trademarks of Microsoft
Corporation.

This repository contains no Microsoft binaries and never will. It contains
only the installer script and documentation; the script modifies a package
that you obtain yourself and keeps every modification on your own machine.

The script changes exactly two things: the MinVersion attribute in the
package's AppxManifest.xml, and the removal of signature metadata that
describes the package's pre-patch contents. It does not rename the package,
patch any executable, alter DRM or account authentication, or change any
system setting outside its own install directory.

Modifying a signed application package invalidates its signature, so the
patched copy is installed as a loose (developer mode) package under your own
user profile. You are responsible for complying with the licence terms that
apply to the package you install and with your local law.
